chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Lists for an advanced course: chapter 6 of the 3rd edition and today's Python"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-08; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.6." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16, chx:P17, chx:P18, chx:P19, chx:P20, chx:P21, chx:P22 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 6 of the 3rd edition teach about lists, sequences and references, which of its printed outputs and programs still hold under Python 3.14.4, and what must an advanced course add so that it matches current Python?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-08." .
